Added `$tw.utils.wikitextParseTree` to the [[WikiText Serialize Plugin]]: a node factory for editors that write WikiText and classification helpers for editors that read it, so an editor never spells a rule name or tag itself. A link around formatted text now serializes as `<$link>` or `<a>` instead of `[[undefined|...]]`.
